-    *   **Classification**: Sample the scalar values $V_i$ at the 8 vertices of the voxel. Compute the configuration index $C$:
-        $$
-        C = \sum_{i=0}^{7} \mathbb{I}(V_i < \tau) \cdot 2^i
-        $$
-        where $\mathbb{I}$ is the indicator function [S1, S2, unofficial].
