-    *   **Edge Intersection**: For each of the 12 edges, check if the corresponding bit in `edgeTable[C]` is set. If set, compute the intersection point $\mathbf{p}$:
-        $$
-        \lambda = \frac{\tau - v_1}{v_2 - v_1}
-        $$
-        $$
-        \mathbf{p} = \text{lerp}(\mathbf{p}_1, \mathbf{p}_2, \lambda)
-        $$
-        where $v_1, v_2$ are vertex values and $\mathbf{p}_1, \mathbf{p}_2$ are vertex positions [S1, S2, unofficial].
