-### Parameters
-*   `Resolution` ($N$): The dimension of the cubic volume grid. Typical values depend on desired detail, e.g., 64, 128, 256 [S1, unofficial].
-*   `isoLevel` ($\tau$): The threshold for isosurface extraction. Default is $0.5$ [S1, unofficial].
